  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When a fire path Immortal Gu House like a giant wheel appears, it takes in Dong clan’s two Gu Immortals Dong Zhu and Gong Ming and starts rolling. Narration names the house Dong clan’s Immortal Gu House Red River Wheel. Inside, Dong Ming shouts revenge for Fang clan’s earlier raid on Dong clan’s treasure moon oasis. Red River Wheel whips up intense flame, collides with Fallen Flower Hall, and can counter that wood path house to a certain extent as its fire infiltrates toward the core Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        2258
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_dong_clan",
        "fac_fang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Gong charges Red River Wheel, Dong Zhu keeps silent and lets out molten flame birds. Fang Gong smashes the birds, and within ten or so breaths Red River Wheel is beaten back with a crumbling surface. Dong Ming and Dong Zhu shout together in panic as the house nears destruction. Red River Wheel shatters completely. Dong Ming and Dong Zhu are sent flying among fragments of the house and corpses of countless Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        2259
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
